        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5100W, Waverly Keyed Knob with Round Regular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Entry Waverly Knob with Matching Rose is available in a huge selection of finishes ranging from oil rubbed bronze, to polished brass, and even polished nickel so you'll be able to find the perfect color. This Waverly Keyed Knob with Round Regular Rose is available in a keyed entry function and also a non-active dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. Emtek's Traditional Stepped Half Round Knob with Round Rose will fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/waverly-knob-with-round-rosette-emtek-8050w\"><b>Waverly Knob with Regular Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Traditional Stepped Half Round Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Dimeter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Keyed Entry Waverly Knob with Matching Rose",
                "description": "The Keyed Entry Waverly Knob with Matching Rose is available in a huge selection of finishes ranging from oil rubbed bronze, to polished brass, and even polished nickel so you'll be able to find the perfect color. This Waverly Keyed Knob with Round Regular Rose is available in a keyed entry function and also a non-active dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. Emtek's Traditional Stepped Half Round Knob with Round Rose will fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.",
                "keywords": "Waverly Keyed Knob with Regular Rosettes, Keyed Entry Waverly Knob with Matching Roses, Emtek 5100W, Emtek 5150W, half round knobs, traditional knobs, Traditional Stepped Half Round Knob with Round Roses, Waverly Keyed Knob with Round Regular Roses,"
